# GameStudio42 Engineering Standards

Follow the policies in `.gs42/standards/` for this workspace.

Read, in order:

1. `.gs42/standards/AGENTS.md`
2. The selected profiles under `.gs42/standards/profiles/`
3. Applicable files under `.gs42/standards/rules/`, including
   `rules/design/` before a player-facing change

Repository files in the current tree remain authoritative for
repository-specific conventions. Art direction and pillars come from
the game, not from a global default.

Reusable procedures live in `.gs42/standards/skills/` (feature design,
playtest review, bugfix, asset integration, balance, release). Read the
matching `SKILL.md` before starting one of those tasks.

Do not push, merge, rebase, or force-push without explicit authorization.
Do not delete published games, wipe uploads, or reset production data
without approval.
